      "message": "It seems that bdname can not be null https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Bluetooth/system/btif/src/bluetooth.cc;l\u003d1339;drc\u003d15978b577cc30ad2c5b8f5e9d1cd5986ea7f09ae",
